{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation to isolate the effect of multiprofile data, comparing to the multimodal multiprofile baseline (config_018: 0.6186 accuracy). Validation accuracy of 0.5907 and F1 of 0.5727 suggest multiprofile may provide some benefit even without image modality, but the relative contribution of profile settings versus modality remains uncertain. The role of aggregation methods and their interaction with fusion strategies also requires further investigation."
}

